Rules to prevent errors :
1. Variables are named as: v0,v1,v2,...,up to v199
2. A total of 200 variables are currently supported.
3. General syntax :
    > COMMAND ARG1 ARG2 ARG3
4. All commands must be written in lowercase format.
5. In later stages we will discuss loops and function syntax which will follow this kind of structure:
LOOP:
command 1
command 2
...
END:
6. Each command can be labeled to simplify the jump process, which has not been implemented yet.

* you can find language sample in boot.txt file

Future extensions:
function implementation
return command for functions
loops implementation
break and continue commands
support for input output from user
more precise error handling
postfix exp ev support (if needed)

